│                          │ deterministic restarts to perturbing and re-optimizing the best configuration found so    │
│                          │ far.  This is effective for this nonsmooth packing problem because high-quality           │
│                          │ arrangements usually require fine adjustment within a promising basin rather than only    │
│                          │ more unrelated random initializations.                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Also sharpen the final soft minimum/maximum temperature and reduce the late step size.    │
│                          │ The broader early temperature still provides stable global movement, while the lower      │
│                          │ final temperature more accurately represents the actual active closest and farthest pairs │
│                          │ used by the evaluator.                                                                    │
