│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ projective_contact_portfolio                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation uses a portfolio of two complementary geometric searches rather than  │
│                          │ relying only on smooth min/max distance surrogates.                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The first search exploits a useful structural hypothesis for diameter-ratio packings:     │
│                          │ strong configurations often contain nearly antipodal pairs. It therefore optimizes seven  │
│                          │ unoriented lines on the sphere and expands them into fourteen antipodal points. This      │
│                          │ converts the problem into minimizing the largest absolute inner product between seven     │
│                          │ directions, using a Riemannian projected optimizer with staged sharpness.                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The second search remains fully unconstrained, but uses a rank-based contact-force model  │
│                          │ instead of differentiating smooth extrema. The closest pairs receive repulsive forces and │
│                          │ the farthest pairs receive attractive forces. Since weights are based on distance ranks,  │
│                          │ the optimization is less sensitive to abrupt changes in the active contact graph. Both    │
│                          │ searches use deterministic multistart, continuation, incumbent perturbations, and exact   │
│                          │ pairwise-ratio selection.                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
