├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ exact_contact_polish                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Add a final high-sharpness contact-polishing phase starting from the best exact           │
│                          │ configuration found by the continuation restarts. The existing optimization uses          │
│                          │ finite-temperature smooth extrema, so its final iterates can remain biased away from the  │
│                          │ true minimum-distance and diameter contacts. This edit uses concentrated soft contact     │
│                          │ weights but accepts a proposed move only when the evaluator’s exact squared ratio         │
│                          │ improves.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The current accepted configuration is retained on every rejected proposal, which is an    │
│                          │ explicit rollback to the last exact-best state. Momentum and step size are strongly       │
│                          │ damped after rejection, preventing repeated deterioration from spending the remaining     │
│                          │ budget outside the best contact basin. This provides a monotone final refinement without  │
│                          │ risking regression of the incumbent.                                                      │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0265                                                                                   │
