│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ rollback_contact_polish                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ The current approach uses 1150-step broad continuations, six perturbed 820-step restarts, │
│                          │ and a 1450-step sharp polish with momentum 0.79--0.84. Its key limitation is that it      │
│                          │ records the best exact state but allows the optimizer to continue drifting away from it   │
│                          │ during sharp late-stage contact optimization.                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This revision retains the soft log-distance extrema objective but changes the search      │
│                          │ configuration as follows:                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - Uses a smoother broad phase with lower initial sharpness and a delayed sharpness        │
│                          │ increase.                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Uses exact-score checkpoints every 8 iterations rather than every 10.                   │
│                          │ - Adds regression-aware rollback: after repeated meaningful score deterioration,          │
│                          │ refinement restores the last exact-best layout, resets momentum, lowers the step size,    │
│                          │ and continues from the better contact basin.                                              │
│                          │ - Uses a separate contact-polish mode with high sharpness but damped adaptive restart     │
│                          │ behavior.                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Adds a deterministic local evolutionary perturbation pass around the final incumbent,   │
│                          │ accepting only exact score improvements.                                                  │
│                          │ - Uses several structured layered seeds, cube/axial seeds, random starts, and incumbent   │
│                          │ perturbations while keeping runtime moderate.                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The returned value remains a finite `(14, 3)` NumPy array.                                │
